# Poison Dart Frog (1/1) attacks on turn 3 and Bot2's Guerrilla Gorilla (2/2) blocks. Bot1 then pays {2} (Mox Emerald and a
# Forest): the Frog gains deathtouch, so its 1 damage destroys the Gorilla (CR 702.2b) and the Gorilla's 2 kills the Frog.
# The sibling scenario without the activation leaves the Gorilla alive with 1 damage.

